{"compatibility":"as-is","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: as-is.

Protected data: none.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

No changes were required. The program has no `model` block, no sampling statements, no parameters, and no protected observed variables; all top-level data are context inputs used only to generate simulated quantities.
","model_safe_stan":"functions {
  real bridge_rng(real t, real t_left, real x_left, real t_right, real x_right) {
    real mu = x_left + (t - t_left) / (t_right - t_left) * (x_right - x_left);
    real sigma2 = (t_right - t) * (t - t_left) / (t_right - t_left);
    return normal_rng(mu, sqrt(sigma2));
  }
}

data {
  int<lower=1> N;
  array[N] real ts;

  real x_left;
  real x_right;

  array[N - 2] int left_idxs;
  array[N - 2] int center_idxs;
  array[N - 2] int right_idxs;
}

generated quantities {
  array[N] real xs;

  xs[1] = x_left;
  xs[N] = x_right;

  for (n in 1:(N - 2)) {
    xs[center_idxs[n]] = bridge_rng(ts[center_idxs[n]],
                                    ts[left_idxs[n]],  xs[left_idxs[n]],
                                    ts[right_idxs[n]], xs[right_idxs[n]]);
  }

}
